                {
                    "text": "work procedures, including advice on safe work practices, food safety, quality and environmental requirements.",
                    "type": "bullet",
                    "order": 9,
                    "indent": 1,
                    "item_id": "assessment_conditions-9",
                    "parent_bullet_item_id": "assessment_conditions-8"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Assessors of this unit must satisfy the requirements for assessors in applicable vocational education and training legislation, frameworks and/or standards.",
                    "type": "paragraph",
